    modified_response: "I have completely designed and implemented the **Chain Reaction** MVP! The application has been built from the ground up prioritizing absolute fluidity, responsive procedural physics, and intense visual game juice.\n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments:\n\n*   **Responsive Canvas Physics Loop**: Built a custom 60fps render engine handling seamless particle drifting, bounding-box collision mapping, and real-time state manipulation. The entire field dynamically responds to a single pinpointed \"Trigger Spark\" tap.\n*   **Juice & Dopamine Mechanics**:\n    *   **Additive Blending**: Particles use deep, neon custom glow effects that explode into a bright core and shoot out outward debris when detonated.\n    *   **Cascading Reactions**: As explosions touch and detonate neighboring particles, massive dynamic combo texts (\"12x!\") physically pop out and float over the canvas.\n    *   **Harmonic Audio Synth**: Implemented a procedural Web Audio API oscillator. Every single explosion triggers a bell-like tone, climbing smoothly through a musical scale with every successive chain hit to construct an escalating melody.\n*   **Polished Game Screens**: The primary views\342\200\224Start, live Gameplay, and interactive Game Over menus\342\200\224are fully responsive, featuring frosted glass overlays (backdrop-blur) and ultra-clean dark aesthetics. \n*   **Ghost Link Framework**: Upon completing or failing a round, the game summarizes your total cleared particles and peak combo, paired with a functional \"Share Ghost Link\" button that neatly generates and copies a mock viral challenge message.\n\nThe game is ready to play. Hit the **TAP TO PLAY** button, wait for the perfect cluster to form, and start the chain reaction!"
    thinking_duration {
