cle Lifecycles**\n\nI\'m now implementing the particle lifecycle, specifically the fading out behavior and color attribute. I\'m focusing on the `life` and `color` properties in the `Particle` interface, ensuring their proper handling within the engine and rendering updates. I\'ve designed the lifecycle from birth to fade out for visual consistency.\n\n\n"
