 the structure of an elegant upgrades object, defining properties like `extraSparks`, `maxMagnetFuel`, `magnetPower`, `sparkRadiusBoost`, and `specialSpawnRate`.\n\n**Calculating Currency Earned**\n\nI am now designing currency mechanics. Level clears yield base \"Quantum Shards\", and perfect clears and high combos provide bonuses. I\'ll implement a persistent `chain_reaction_shards_v2` currency stored in `localStorage`, similar to the high score.\n\n\n**Verifying Spark Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing and testing the multiple trigger spark mechanics within the `GameEngine`. My current approach involves tracking `sparksLeft` instead of a simple boolean for `tapped`, enabling users to drop additional sparks if they have them. This creates strategic opportunities as rounds won\'t end until the player has exhausted their available sparks *and* there are no active explosives. This rule is extremely fun!\n\n\n"
