  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Celebrating Project Completion**\n\nI\'m incredibly happy to announce that the project is complete! The linter, compiler, and server restart went perfectly, and I\'ve achieved a satisfying high-casual progression game. It\'s a gorgeous state.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully completed the requested feature enhancements, creating a highly polished, progression-focused MVP experience for **Chain Reaction**. \n\nHere is a summary of the implemented features:\n\n- **Progression Physics & Level Scaling**:\n  - As levels climb, floating element hitboxes shrink and baseline velocities scale up progressively.\n  - Sourcing Specialty **Gravity Pulse** and **Cross-Star Splitter** cores is regulated by Level metrics, balancing skill and excitement.\n  \n- **Interactive Upgrade Store**:\n  - **Quantum Research Upgrades**: Players can purchase upgrades across five mechanics: **Cascade Spark Batteries** (extra sparks), **Quantum Fuel Modules** (higher herder fuel capacity), **Catalyst Cores** (larger explosive shockwave radius), **Tractor Drive Pulse** (increased physical pull speed), and **Reactor Volatility** (higher spawn rate of specialty cores).\n  - **Glow Matrix Theme Decodes**: Spend harvested Shards to solve core signatures and unlock themed aesthetic elements, including the neon magenta **Stardust Nebula**, bright green **Hyper-Void Matrix**, and pure plasma **Solar Flare Supernova**.\n\n- **Multi-Spark Detonation Cascades**:\n  - Players can drop additional detonator cores to salvage split fragments and restart decaying cascades as long as they have battery sparks remaining.\n  - Added real-time glowing energy battery indicators to the bottom tactical dock.\n\n- **High-Dopamine Reward Systems**:\n  - Securing rounds yields a full **Quantum Cores Harvest** shard breakdown table tracking secured base gains, combo chain peaks, and perfect all-clears.\n  - Added a retro custom chime cascade synthesis code to audio engines triggering cozy upward arpeggios on shop purchases.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 621628346
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
