  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Addictive Features**\n\nI\'ve got the initial application structure, including `/src/App.tsx`, and core concepts finalized. Now, I\'m diving into research on slot machine addictiveness, planning to integrate some key features. First up is \"Loss Disguised as a Win\" (LDWs). I\'m exploring how to subtly include this in the design.\n\n\n**Implementing Consolation Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now integrating \"Reactor Overload Consolation Payouts\" to make level failures feel less punishing. I\'m building in celebratory sounds and a flashing \"CONSOLATION PAYOUT! +X \342\232\241\" panel, rewarding shards even on a \"loss\". I\'m aiming to trigger a feeling of a rewarding near-win event.\n\n\n**Designing Rescue Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating a \"Near Miss\" sequence! I plan to implement a warning with screen vibration, followed by a \"Lucky Re-Spin Rescue\" option. Players will be able to spend a small amount of shards for a \"Second-Chance Spark\" to immediately continue the round, preserving their \"flow state\" and enhancing engagement, creating an additive loop.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 354796832
    }
