    thinking: "**Adding Audio Behaviors**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing the new slot machine and near-miss audio behaviors, starting with editing `/src/lib/audio.ts`. I\'m carefully crafting the new audio functions, specifically `playSlotSpin`. I\'m starting by adding the oscillator and considering error handling too.\n\n\n**Refining Audio Functions**\n\nI\'ve just added `playSlotStop`! I implemented sine waves, with exponential ramps to zero and back, similar to the spin sound. The frequencies and gain values are experimental, but I\'m ready to iterate and refine them further, to get the perfect feel for stopping the slot!\n\n\n**Implementing Payout Sound**\n\nI\'m now integrating the slot payout sound! I\'ve created the `playSlotPayout` function, and it uses `createOscillator` and `createGain` for different scale arpeggios, depending on the jackpot. I am using triangle waves. I\'m carefully managing the timing, and gain, with linear and exponential ramps.\n\n\n**Generating Near Miss Sounds**\n\nI\'ve just added the `playNearMissAlert` function, and it\'s built using dual oscillators with sawtooth waves, creating a high-urgency sound effect. I\'m carefully managing the timing and amplitude envelopes with linear and exponential ramps to give it a rapid falloff. It\'s a nice, sharp sound!\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 421949035
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
