  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the React Component**\n\nI\'m incredibly pleased to report the linter passed instantly! Now, I\'m focusing on modifying `/src/App.tsx`. The goal is to introduce three addictive slot machine mechanics. I\'m starting by designing the \"Reactor Multiplier Reel\" game for the `ROUND_OVER` screen.\n\n\n**Implementing the Slot Machine**\n\nI\'ve decided to create an exciting Slot Machine column interface that appears when `didWinLast` is true. I\'ll need state variables for `slotSpinning`, `slotReels`, `payoutApplied`, `slotMultiplier`, and `spinOutcomeMsg`. I\'ll animate the reels with `setInterval` and play sound effects (`playSlotSpin`, `playSlotStop`). The reels will spin for 1.5 seconds, then stop sequentially. I\'ll use a random choice to determine the final combination and outcome.\n\n\n**Defining Payout Probabilities**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of the slot machine payouts! I\'m planning to introduce weighted probabilities for more thrilling results. I\'ve mapped out potential winning combinations: Cherry, Spark, Diamond, and the Reactor 7 jackpot! I\'m focusing on the payout multipliers and their corresponding messages. I\'m also including \'near-miss\' and \'no match\' scenarios to keep the suspense high, and ensure a higher retention probability.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Outcomes**\n\nI\'m now implementing a \"shard rain\" overlay effect upon a payout, setting `payoutApplied = true`. I envision neon borders, flashing highlights, and satisfying sound effects for this slot reel, to enhance the visual appeal.\n\n\n**Adding Second Chance Mechanic**\n\nI\'ve added the \"SECOND-CHANCE QUANTUM TRIGGER\" button to enhance user engagement. It offers an extra cascade for 50 Shards, or free the first time, using `engineRef.current.resumeWithExtraSpark()` and resetting the screen to \'GAME\'. It is an addictive feature!\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Implementing \"Loss Disguised as Win\"**\n\nI\'m now implementing the \"CONSOLATION CORE EXTRACTOR\"! If the user fails, instead of just a \"Tactical Fault\" with no payout, they\'ll receive a micro-payout, computed as `Math.floor(liveStats.cleared * 2.5)` shards. The payout will be highlighted with flashing green/gold borders, a coin sound, and a custom title.\n\n\n**Tracking the Winning Streak**\n\nI\'m now implementing the \"Level Cleared Streak Tracker\" to drive repeat engagement! I\'m creating a `clearStreak` state variable, incrementing it on success and resetting on failure. I\'ll visualize the streak with a dynamic meter, like \"\360\237\224\245 4 LEVEL STREAK \360\237\224\245\", and implement a reward system that gives an extra +15 shards per streak level, creating significant loss aversion to enhance the addictive design. I\'m starting by studying the import statements.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 59922231
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
