he payout banner and setting up the score calculation based on the round results.\n\n\n**Implementing High Score Logic**\n\nI\'ve just added high score saving using `localStorage` along with incorporating exception handling. Also, on failure, I\'ve reset `clearStreak` and the shard stats, and calculated consolation shards for losses disguised as wins, paying them out and playing the reward audio. I\'ve also reset `nearMissSparksPurchased`.\n\n\n"
