leek matte-charcoal tactical operations simulator.\n- **Neon Indicator Rings**: Highly fluid custom SVG rings tracking grid clearances with beautiful colors.\n- **Micro-Animations**: Features subtle entrance drift animations, staggered drum-clicks, and jackpot flash transitions.\n"
