  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Addictive Features**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the addictive elements of slot machines, specifically focusing on how to integrate those features without replicating the physical mechanism of spinning reels. My goal is to extract the core psychological triggers and explore alternative implementations. I\'m exploring patterns, rewards, and the illusion of control to refine our approach.\n\n\n**Exploring Reinforcement Strategies**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on integrating unpredictable rewards directly into core gameplay, steering clear of visual reel-based mechanisms. My focus is on implementing variable ratio schedules through unexpected multipliers, criticals, and \"cascade surges\". I aim to punch up the near-miss effect and build in exciting visual and auditory feedback like rapidly rolling counters and dynamic particle effects. I\'m exploring \"Quantum Extraction\" as a new \"lever\" concept, with dynamic progress bars and resonant visuals.\n\n\n**Refining Multiplier Implementation**\n\nI\'m developing the \"Reactor Stabilization Charge\" as the core mechanic, replacing the slot machine\'s visuals. \"Extract & Solidify Cores\" triggers a rapid charging sequence with particle effects and an escalating multiplier with tension-building audio. I\'m focusing on \"Critical Mutation\" modifiers like \"QUANTUM STABLE\" or \"COSMIC OVERCLOCK\" to maintain the variable ratio, high-feedback loop and near-miss anticipation of classic slot machines.\n\n\n**Enhancing Anti-Matter Cells**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the \"DECAY\" type cells, aiming to make them more impactful in the game. I\'m exploring an active magnetic repulsion field, either knocking away or attracting good particles. Additionally, I\'m considering having them emit a miniature *Anti-matter Wave* after absorbing an explosion, temporarily neutralizing nearby explosives. My goal is to add more strategic difficulty through these mechanics.\n\n\n**Developing Decay Cell Mechanics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on decay cells, focusing on making them more strategic through enhanced abilities. I\'m exploring an active repulsion field to affect nearby elements, as well as a spawning feature where un-cleared particles become Decay Cells after a set period. I\'m also planning to scale the number of Decay particles more aggressively at higher levels. I\'m also now focusing on refining the \'gravity turbulence waves\', adding a radical velocity scrambling element.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 871621597
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
